From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felipe Paiva <felipe.paiva@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 10:44:35 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] sms-region

The Master System Screen section gains a Region row (Auto, Japan, USA,
Europe), stored as `sms = europe` in Config/region.txt. A Master System
game opens with Genesis Plus GX's genesis_plus_gx_region_detect set to
ntsc-j, ntsc-u or pal; Auto leaves the option unanswered, as before.
Game Gear and Mega Drive on the same core never get it. The core's own
database marks only about 23 Master System titles as European, so most
European carts ran at 60 Hz and PAL pacing never engaged for them.
